WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.440
Semimaru was <i>so</i> close to winning!

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.360
Just a little more and he'd of gotten rid of Yuma Tsukumo!

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.780
It's <i>so</i> frustrating!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.780
But we'll definitely win next time, indeed!

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.740
Hey, you fly bastard.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.620
You've done nothing but run your mouth.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.580
Failure will not be tolerated again!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.090
Yes! I-I understand, Lord Vector!

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.960
I already have our next assassin lined up!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.550
He's incredibly strong, I assure you!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.720
But he is rather moody...

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.680
He's really fussy over the whole seniority thing, and I'm younger...

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.600
Are you messing around with me?!

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:45.770
I-I am sorry...! But he truly is strong...!

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.770
M-My Senpai runs the strongest Water-Attribute deck...!

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.900
Water-Attribute...?

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.820
Just like Ryouga Kamishiro. He also uses a Water-Attribute deck, right?

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:03.330
I wonder why I get this nasty feeling in my chest whenever I think of that guy.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.920
That's it! Okay, Heartland!

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.460
Then send your Senpai with your Number to take down Ryouga!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.630
As you wish!

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.140
<i>The Duel in that Undersea Temple... Where I saw that legend...</i>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.310
<i>Those had to have been my memories...</i>

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.690
<i>Just who I am... are we?</i>

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:40.120
<i>Rio, we were always together. In this world, could we...?</i>

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:50.670
<i>I know that place...all too well.</i>

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>We were... Our memories...</i>

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:24.810
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.860
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:35.320
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:38.870
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:43.750
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:50.090
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:53.300
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.180
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.810
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:03.890
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:12.360
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:30.390
Come now, kids, don't be shy. Dig in and eat your fill.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.400
Thank you very much, Ma'am.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:35.360
"Duelists of Sorrow - 
The Gimmick Puppets' Rumble of Darkness!!"

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.940
For bothering to let me stay here
 and invite me to breakfast on top of it.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.070
But why are you wearing one of our uniforms?

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:42.030
Ah, that's 'cuz Yuma lent it to me, since I forgot to bring a change of clothes.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.620
You can crash here as long as ya need, III.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.120
Thank you, III-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:58.550
Since you came, Yuma's seemed in a much better mood... and he's finally eaten my rice dishes again.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:03.220
No, no, ma'am, I'm just lucky that I could eat something so tasty.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.260
Tch...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.220
Though I could definitely go for some Duel Rice...

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.480
Hey, Astral, you want anything to chow on?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:24.110
You're a bit young to be going senile, dear.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:29.830
Y-Yeah! I mean this isn't the time to sit here eating leisurely!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:34.210
That Heartland jerk's definitely gonna try something.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:37.630
I think you should try and let Shark and Kaito know.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.920
Kaito's hard to get in contact with, since he always seems to be off investigating something.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.590
And, well, Shark's Shark.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.050
He's been staying by Rio-<i>san</i>'s side at the hospital.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:51.970
After we're done eating, how about we go visit them?

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.810
Aaww, it's raining.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.150
I'm gonna bring it by runnin' ahead!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.530
Yuma, you don't have to fake it for us...

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.410
He still needs some time.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:11.120
Astral was a pretty important friend for him, after all...

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.920
<i>You've reached your emergency nursing center.</i>

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:25.170
<i>You've reached your emergency nursing center.</i>

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.720
Where are you heading?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.430
That area is for authorized staff only...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.680
The General Public Area is...

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.350
Hey, the floor here is soaked with water!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.060
Hold it, you!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.150
We can't have this! Just what are you-

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.570
Huh? Don't you know your place?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.650
Watch your damn mouth!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.080
Seriously...! That's all you have, you bitch?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.020
You're...!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.280
Wh-What the hell are you doing?!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.990
What'd you just do to Shark Sis?!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.490
You're...Yuma Tsukumo, I presume?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.040
Why do you know me?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.750
Are you a Barian?!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:41.170
After I've beaten the shark bastard, you'll be next.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.250
So feel free to shiver while you wait.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.460
H-He disappeared...!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.090
Yuma, but "shark bastard", he means...!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.220
Could he mean Shark?!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.480
Shark's not answering!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.320
Why?!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.320
Yuma, let's split up and search for him!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.240
Yeah!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.070
Then I'll go let Tetsuo-<i>kun</i> and the others know!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.780
I'll tell my brothers!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.280
What's wrong, III?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.000
<i>That's right... On that day...</i>

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.710
<i>On that day, it was raining like this...</i>

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:27.960
<i>Ryouga!</i>

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.180
<i>Teach me how to Duel again when we get back, okay?!</i>

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:35.390
<i>Sure, but you'll start crying again in no time!</i>

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.100
<i>Rio's not gonna cry this time!</i>

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.140
<i>You sure will!</i>

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.270
<i>I won't cry!</i>

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.480
<i>I said I'm not gonna cry and I mean it!</i>

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:42.850
<i>Bullcrap!</i>

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.070
<i>There now, you two! Behave yourselves!</i>

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.760
<i>How are their parents?</i>

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.220
<i>It was no use. We lost them just moments ago.</i>

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.310
<i>I see...</i>

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:28.270
<i>That's right... Ever since then, Rio and I have been alone...</i>

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.780
<i>Therefore... That place...</i>

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.740
He isn't home, or at school, and no one's seen him around the city...

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.530
And we still can't get in touch with him...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.790
And it's Shark's fault Rio-<i>san</i>'s in the shape she's in...

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.000
Ya know, the twist is, we could really use Astral right about now.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.840
Astral...

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:08.810
<i>Haven't been here since...that accident.</i>

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:13.190
<i>The place where me and Rio spent our time when we were young...</i>

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:19.580
<i>Right... Our memories have to be here.</i>

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.660
<i>Give it back, Rio!</i>

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.700
<i>Those are the important cards I got from Dad!</i>

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.500
<i>No way! It's not fair that only you get them, Ryouga!</i>

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.080
<i>Wait up, Rio!</i>

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.550
<i>Give 'em back already!</i>

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.140
<i>Rio!</i>

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:23.810
<i>Look out!</i>

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.230
<i>Ryouga!</i>

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.110
<i>What's wrong? Are you okay?</i>

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.070
<i>Dear!</i>

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.990
<i>Mama!</i>

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.530
<i>It'll be okay, Rio...</i>

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:43.450
<i>It'll be okay...</i>

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:49.080
<i>I'm sorry... I got the cards you gave me all dirty...</i>

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.040
<i>Dummy! You don't need to worry about that!</i>

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.670
<i>Dear, we need to treat his wound.</i>

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:00.930
<i>Right, there's no doubt about it. That's my wound.</i>

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.010
<i>It still tingles...</i>

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.430
<i>Those are my memories...</i>

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.180
<i>Our precious...</i>

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:11.650
Right... I'm no Barian...

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:16.570
Who's there?!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.700
So you're Ryouga Kamishiro?

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.290
You're...!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.250
You won't get away!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.340
What the hell did you do to me, you bastard...?!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.760
"You bastard"? Who do you think you are?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.310
Learn your place!

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.770
Huh? The hell are you talking about?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.400
Watch the way you speak to others!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.770
A lowly human addressing a great Barian that way...!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.780
You're a Barian?!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.240
I hear you like to boast about
 being the strongest of the Water-Attribute.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:08.620
As your better, I'll teach you a thing or two about what's better than a Shark in the Water-Attribute!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.580
Don't screw with me!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:11.960
Shit...

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.920
What's this...? My strength...

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.380
Hmm? Have I seen your face somewhere before...?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:21.420
Forget it. How do you like the taste of my poison?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.130
Did you say poison?!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:28.180
Yeah, it's only a matter of time before my poison eats away your entire body.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.350
So I'll have you Duel me now!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:34.190
L-Like I'd play around with some weakling like you...!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.400
It's about time you stop pushing yourself to hold together.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:38.070
You might hold on for a while...

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.650
But how 'bout your little sister?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:41.780
Rio?!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.320
You didn't...!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:46.780
Yeah. A little bird told me about you siblings...

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.950
There's only one way to cure that poison.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.080
You'll have to beat me in this Duel!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:58.170
So you have no choice but to Duel me!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:58.960
Shit...!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.250
Hold it!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.390
Y-You're...!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:12.980
What's wrong? Have you forgotten, Ryouga?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.600
The face of your number one fan?!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.770
IV!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.490
And you're... Tron's son, if I recall.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.030
Man, you're getting sloppy.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.120
Poison?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.780
Do generally you let yourself get stung?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.990
Though I guess he's got some skills.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.710
Why are you here?!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:40.710
I was asked to come here. III told me to look after you.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.130
Who said I needed <i>your</i> help?!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.720
I don't really care about <i>you</i>...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.600
But, I do care about your sister...

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.350
Rio...?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:04.900
Seeing your sister suffering and unconscious again like this leaves a bad taste in my mouth...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:05.740
That's why...

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:11.030
I'll use my fanservice to beat the hell outta this guy in an instant!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.200
You can sit back and watch.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.910
Stop running your mouth off!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.920
Y-You bastards dare mock me?!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.920
Stop screwin' around!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.300
Who da hell do ya think you are?!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.590
Come at me at the same time, ya damn bastards!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.180
Oh? How about it, Ryouga?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.930
Feel like taking that Barian bastard on?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.390
Rio...! I'll save Rio!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.440
Good. It seems we're all in agreement.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.940
But there's a teeny tiny condition.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.070
Condition?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:47.690
You two look like you're 10 years my junior.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.450
A superior should always stand above his juniors.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.030
Your Senpai's Life Points'll be 8000.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.910
While you two juniors get to have 2000 Life Points a piece.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.750
For someone calling himself "Senpai", you're a pretty stingy bastard.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.290
Fine, then. Not a bad handicap.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.960
You youngsters are pretty cheeky!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.880
Before the Duel's decided, though...

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:13.720
The poison'll finish ya, and you'll wash up on the beach.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.140
So that's your true form!?

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.270
Let's Go!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.940
Duel Disk, set!

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.660
D-Gazer, Set!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.290
Duel!!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.090
Darn, where the heck'd Shark get to?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.180
Yuma, my big brother just called.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.140
Shark's in grave danger!

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:58.520
I'll start things off! My turn! Draw!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.770
<i>I have to save Rio, no matter the cost.</i>

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.360
I Summon Saber Shark!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.780
In a Tag Duel, none of us can attack during our first turns.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:19.330
I set a card, and end my turn.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.210
That isn't like you.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.000
You seem awfully cautious all of a sudden.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.790
I can't lose this Duel!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.300
I have to win no matter what.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:36.430
Come, let's go. It's my turn! Draw!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.140
I Summon Death Chironex.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:51.610
Now, when I control a Water-Attribute Monster, I

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.070
can Special Summon this guy from my hand.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.990
Come, Silence Sea Nettle!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.330
Your Senpai's gonna be serious now.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.500
Keep your eyes open.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:09.040
I Overlay my Level Four Death Chironex and Silence Sea Nettle!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.510
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.510
Xyz Summon!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.220
Show yourself, Number 4!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.810
The transparent warrior who drifts through chaos.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:32.730
Sting everything in this world that lay before you! O, great Senpai!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:37.530
Enter the fray! Stealth Kuragen the Deadly Poisonous Jellyfish!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.160
Number 4!?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.250
The number four's <i>my</i> thing!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.710
It's a special numeral!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.630
And what's sadder, Number 4 is a friggin' Jellyfish of all things!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.250
Are you mocking Jellyfish?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.460
The Jellyfish is the supreme lifeform of Water.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:58.760
It's an immortal creature that stings whatever it touches, filling it with deadly poison.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.640
So you say.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.180
So let's see if you've got some bite to that bark.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.520
What shall I do?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.650
I think how your punk friend is doin' says it all.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.360
S-shut the hell up, you damn jellyfish!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:16.320
Fine, then let's finish this up!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.870
I activate Stealth Kuragen's effect!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:25.790
Once per turn, during any player's turn, I can destroy one Water-Attribute Monster on the field.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.620
I'll target Saber Shark!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:33.460
And ta top things off, Saber Shark's Attack Power is inflicted as

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.710
damage to an opponent player!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.180
Poison Styx!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:50.400
That didn't hurt you that much, right Ryouga?

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.270
That should be obvious!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.270
What a bunch of fake courage.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.160
Let me show you my Fanservice now, ya freakin' Jellyfish bastard!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.490
My turn! Draw!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.080
I Summon Gimmick Puppet Des Troy!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:16.130
And then, I activate the Magic Card, Precious Cards of Puppets!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:21.510
This card destroys one Gimmick Puppet Monster on the field!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.430
I target Des Troy!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.730
And then I draw one card!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:34.520
Then, when Des Troy is destroyed by a card effect,

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:41.490
I can Special Summon two Gimmick Puppet Monsters from my hand, provided they have 1000 or less Attack Points!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:49.040
Show yourselves, Gimmick Puppet Night Joker! And Necro Doll!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:56.590
Now, let's go! I Overlay my Level Eight Night Joker and Necro Doll!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:02.260
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.050
Xyz Summon!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.180
Show yourself, Number 15!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:13.350
The envoy from Hell who pulls the strings of fate!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:18.020
Open the curtains once more on the stage in the deepest darkness!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:22.110
Gimmick Puppet - Giant Killer!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.820
That Number is...!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.490
Shark!?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.210
Shark, you've been poisoned...

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.000
I activate Giant Killer's effect!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:43.430
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can destroy all other Xyz Monsters on the field!

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:04.950
And then you'll chew on the destroyed Monster's Attack Power as damage!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.620
Stealth Kuragen's Attack Power is 1900!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.330
Accept my Fanservice!

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.290
Destruction Cannon!!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.300
Yeah!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.050
It's the Giant Killer he got from Yuma!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:27.930
Things shine their brightest in the hands
 of their original owner, ya know.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.390
Shine the brightest?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.900
Don't try gettin' all high and mighty with me, punk!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:41.110
You punk bastards, who are 10 years my junior have no right to get all uppity with me!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.110
What!?

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.280
What's going on? He has two monsters all of a sudden!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.490
What the heck...?

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.990
You Jellyfish Bastard!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:53.790
It's not Bastard! It's Senpai!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:02.960
I'll thoroughly show you punks, the strongest, most legendary Jellyfish to ever exist!

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:23.900
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:26.440
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.650
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.070
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:34.450
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:37.000
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.080
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:39.120
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:42.500
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.840
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:50.180
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:53.180
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:55.140
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.520
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.390
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:02.690
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:07.780
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:09.030
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:13.030
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:18.410
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.620
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:28.130
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:44.020
The poison from Kurage's poison has started affecting Shark and IV!

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:48.230
And he plays another Monster that drives them deeper into Hell!

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:50.900
Stand! Stand and fight, Shark!

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:52.950
If it's that Number...!

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.370
Stay strong, Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:56.370
The teamwork between my brother and Shark...!

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:59.080
I-I'll save Rio!

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:01.620
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:05.130
"Shark and IV's World-Shaking Mayhem!! Hell-Shark Tag Team"

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:08.840
Listen well to the anger of equality!
